# Generated social assets. Binaries, not site content — nothing in here is
# built or served. Regenerate with scripts/make-tiktok-frames.ps1 rather than
# committing 3 MB of PNGs. The README, the posting schedule, and the
# animated-diagram source (real hand-authored HTML/SVG/GSAP, not a
# generated binary) are the parts worth keeping, so they're force-added.
social/*
!social/README.md
!social/tiktok/ready-to-upload/SCHEDULE.md
!social/diagrams/
!social/diagrams/*
!social/static/
!social/static/*

